msgid "slicing -- ``a[1:5]``, ``a[::2]``, ``m[:, 0]``;"
msgstr "슬라이싱 -- ``a[1:5]``\\ , ``a[::2]``\\ , ``m[:, 0]``\\ ;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:133
msgid "single-axis indexing of a higher-rank array -- ``m[0]``;"
msgstr "고차원 배열의 단일 축 인덱싱 -- ``m[0]``\\ ;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:135
msgid "iterating an n-D array;"
msgstr "n차원 배열의 반복;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:136
msgid ""
":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.reshape`, when the requested layout is compatible;"
msgstr ":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.reshape`\\ , 요청된 레이아웃이 호환될 때;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:138
msgid ":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.transpose` / ``.T``;"
msgstr ":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.transpose` / ``.T``\\ ;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:139
msgid ":func:`~numpy.frombuffer`;"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.frombuffer`\\ ;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:140
msgid ":func:`~numpy.asarray`, when the dtype matches."
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.asarray`\\ , dtype이 일치할 때."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:142
msgid "The following operations return **copies**:"
msgstr "다음 연산들은 **복사본**\\ 을 반환합니다:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:144
msgid ":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.copy`;"
msgstr ":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.copy`\\ ;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:145
msgid ":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.flatten`;"
msgstr ":meth:`~numpy.ndarray.flatten`\\ ;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:146
msgid "boolean indexing -- ``a[mask]``;"
msgstr "불리언 인덱싱 -- ``a[mask]``\\ ;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:147
msgid "arithmetic -- ``a + b``, ``a * 2``, ``np.sin(a)``;"
msgstr "산술 -- ``a + b``\\ , ``a * 2``\\ , ``np.sin(a)``\\ ;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:148
msgid ":func:`~numpy.array` -- always copies, even from another array;"
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.array` -- 항상 복사하며, 다른 배열로부터도 복사합니다;"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:150
msgid ":func:`~numpy.concatenate`."
msgstr ":func:`~numpy.concatenate`\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/shape/views-and-copies.rst:152
msgid ""
"Reach for an explicit copy only when an independent buffer is genuinely "
"needed. On a camera with limited RAM, the difference between a view and a "
"copy is often the difference between code that fits and code that does not."
msgstr ""
"독립적인 버퍼가 정말로 필요할 때만 명시적인 복사본에 손을 뻗으십시오. RAM이 제한된 카메라에서 뷰와 복사본의 차이는 흔히 들어맞는 "
"코드와 그렇지 않은 코드의 차이가 됩니다."
